        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "## Summary\n\n- **Viable.** Every photo of an optimised library keeps a 360 px copy on the iPhone.\n- Other apps index once and then follow the library's changes.",
          "truncated": false,
          "commentable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "---\n\n## Plan propuesto\n\n### Index the whole library\n\n- [ ] Store each photo's feature print in Core Data, next to what users have today\n- [ ] Index changes in the background with the library's change history\n- [ ] Show indexing progress on the home screen",
          "truncated": false,
          "commentable": false
        },
